message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the details below."
type: software
title: "River early warning across 671 British catchments"
authors:
  - family-names: McNeill
    given-names: Paul Martin
    affiliation: "Queen's University Belfast"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mcneillium/river-early-warning"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Code, protocols and results for a study of how far ahead river flow and high-flow or low-flow warnings can be forecast without future weather, on the CAMELS-GB v2 catchments, including transfer to unseen regions and calibrated uncertainty. Work in progress; not peer reviewed.
